    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ibyo ku ngoma ya Ahazi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka wa cumi n'irindwi wo ku ngoma ya Peka mwene Remaliya, Ahazi mwene Yotamu umwami w'Abayuda yarimye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ajya ku ngoma amaze imyaka makumyabiri avutse, amara imyaka makumyabiri n'itandatu i Yerusalemu ari ku ngoma, ariko ntiyakora ibishimwa imbere y'Uwiteka Imana ye, nka sekuruza Dawidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guteg 12.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahubwo agendana ingeso z'abami b'Abisirayeli, ndetse acisha umuhungu we mu muriro akurikije ibizira byakorwaga n'abanyamahanga Uwiteka yirukanye imbere y'Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yajyaga atamba ibitambo, akosereza imibavu mu ngoro no mu mpinga z'imisozi no munsi y'igiti kibisi cyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
